(NORTHWIND BANK LIMITED) Tj T*
(DIGITAL LENDING POLICY \(FICTIONAL SAMPLE, VERSION 1.4\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Scope. This policy applies to all loans sourced or serviced through digital lending apps) Tj T*
(\(DLAs\), whether operated by the Bank or by a lending service provider \(LSP\) engaged by it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Disbursal and repayment. Loan amounts must be disbursed directly into the bank account of) Tj T*
(the borrower. Disbursal through a pass-through account or pool account of any LSP or third) Tj T*
(party is prohibited. Repayments must be made directly into the Bank's account, without passing) Tj T*
(through any account of an LSP.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
6 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 7 0 R >>
endobj
7 0 obj
<< /Length 763 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
12 TL
50 750 Td
(3. Key Fact Statement. Before the loan agreement is executed, the borrower must receive a Key) Tj T*
(Fact Statement \(KFS\) in a standard format. The KFS must state the annual percentage rate \(APR\),) Tj T*
(which is the all-inclusive cost of the loan, the recovery mechanism, the details of the) Tj T*
(grievance redressal officer, and the cooling-off period.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Cooling-off period. Borrowers may exit a digital loan during a cooling-off period by) Tj T*
(repaying the principal and the proportionate APR, without any penalty. The cooling-off period) Tj T*
(is at least three days for loans with a tenor of seven days or more, and at least one day for) Tj T*
(loans with a tenor of less than seven days.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
8 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 9 0 R >>
