(5. Fees and charges. No fee or charge that is not mentioned in the KFS may be charged to the) Tj T*
(borrower. Fees payable to an LSP are paid by the Bank and must not be charged to the borrower) Tj T*
(directly.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Borrower data. Digital lending apps may collect only the data needed for the loan, with the) Tj T*
(borrower's explicit consent. Apps must not access the borrower's contacts, media files or call) Tj T*
(logs. One-time access to the camera, microphone and location is allowed only for onboarding.) Tj T*
(Borrowers may withdraw consent and ask for their data to be deleted.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Credit limits. A borrower's credit limit must not be increased automatically. Any increase) Tj T*
(requires the borrower's explicit consent, which must be recorded.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
10 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 11 0 R >>
