(8. Grievance redressal. Every DLA and LSP must have a nodal grievance redressal officer whose) Tj T*
(contact details are shown in the app and on the website. Complaints must be resolved within 30) Tj T*
(days. If a complaint is not resolved within 30 days, the borrower may escalate it to the RBI) Tj T*
(Ombudsman under the Integrated Ombudsman Scheme.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. Recovery practices. Recovery agents must not harass or intimidate borrowers. The name and) Tj T*
(contact details of the recovery agent must be shared with the borrower before the agent) Tj T*
(contacts them. Recovery calls may be made only between 8 a.m. and 7 p.m.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10. Credit reporting. Every loan disbursed through a DLA must be reported to the credit) Tj T*
(information companies, regardless of its tenor.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
